  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapisign v2.0\n\t\t&#39;How to&#39;\n\n### How to rename a document within Capisign\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 3 Sep, 2024 at  3:20 PM\n\n\t\tTo rename a document on the overview page within Capisign.\n\nPlease note: the signed document cannot be renamed.\n\nNavigation: Capisign > Overview\n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to rename an uploaded file by clicking the “Three dots” and selecting the “Rename” option.\n\nOnce performed, a window with the \"Rename\" option will pop up, allowing a user to rename a document.\n\nOnce performed, a user will be able to save the progress and the changes will be displayed for a selected document.\n\nImportant to note: Currently if there is a dot symbol (.) within the name of the document it might cause an error, so please remove and check any special characters.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117934\">Capisign v2.0</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000198319\">&#39;How to&#39;</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to rename a document within Capisign\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 3 Sep, 2024 at  3:20 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">To rename a document on the overview page within Capisign.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\">Please note:</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;the signed document cannot be renamed.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 16, 26); margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Navigation: Capisign &gt; Overview</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9183367210/original/yQp6C5dN0GY4pkqUYlrJG8cIrVW5Z5k5EQ.png?1680087549\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9183367210\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Following the navigation process, a user is able to rename an uploaded file by clicking the “Three dots” and selecting the “Rename” option.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9183367255/original/f_BRMdhIDTOZmhO7e1Z8CsVHRDitnvjdxw.png?1680087590\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9183367255\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Once performed, a window with the \"Rename\" option will pop up, allowing a user to rename a document.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9183367329/original/56IHzO5dX-PV6q4ofb9jbQt2eIX7RpJiPg.png?1680087619\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9183367329\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Once performed, a user will be able to save the progress and the changes will be displayed for a selected document.</span></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Important to note:&nbsp;</span></strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Currently if there is a dot symbol (.) within the name of the document it might cause an error, so please remove and check any special characters.</span></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000240724\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000240724/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000240724\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000240724/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"